block=intro+'\n'.join(rows)+'\n\n**Most explicit disagreements:** HOOD has Redburn\'s Sell case against Goldman\'s Buy/Rothera thesis and Bernstein\'s Outperform; SPGI has a more cautious Jefferies sales view versus its analyst\'s constructive portfolio view; KKR\'s USI debate pits capital monetization against the recurring earnings sold; BX\'s debate pits strong flows against fee yield and returns at scale. These are attributed positions in the linked company readouts, not a composite consensus.\n\n**Source limits:** the latest Goldman HOOD and COIN result emails provide headlines, not the underlying models. The Redburn prediction-market sales email contains conflicting industry-volume figures, which are flagged and excluded from sizing assumptions. Legal downside cases remain broker scenarios; they do not establish the outcome of any proceeding.\n\n'
